    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n112065" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φονώδης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ες</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>like blood,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀσμὴ φ.</span> a smell <i>as of blood,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				6.4.6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>bloodthirsty,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>4 Ma.</u>
				10.17
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βλέπειν φονῶδές τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alciphr.
					3.21
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> Medic.,
				<i>deadly, malignant,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυρετός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Morb.</u>
					2.67
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
